  faqs: { en: [
    { q: "How long does a contract limit increase take?", a: "A risk change request on a live Tradovate account is reviewed manually and usually clears within about a business day or two. Prop-firm requests depend on the firm's own turnaround." },
    { q: "Why does my order still reject after the limit was raised?", a: "Usually one of two things: you don't have enough margin for the bigger position (quantity caps never override margin rules), or a separate limit is in play, such as the exchange position limit or a prop-firm cap stacked on top of yours." },
